        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 2440-601, 12-3/4 Auxiliary Spring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 12-3/4\" long auxiliary spring is for use on gates up to 50 pounds for self closing. Adjustable tension allow you to determine how much closing force you apply to the gate (how hard/fast the door self closes). Includes adjustment tool. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/Bommer-2440-size.gif?v=1704442292\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer 2440 Gate Spring Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIncludes (4) #12 x 1-1/4\" round head wood screws for installation. This economical gate closing device is non-handed.  Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Bommer 2440-601 12-3/4 Auxiliary Spring\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Length: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish Color: Bright Black</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: 50 Lbs. Maximum</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Wrought Steel Heads</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Tension</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/2440.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer 2440 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/gate-hardware\">Gate Hardware</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
